# Baseline B-09 (F-08): HELLO with a user_agent (boltkit's HELLO map)
# opens a usable session: its SUCCESS names a server and a connection id,
# and a RESET after it succeeds. The HELLO is written out, not
# !: AUTO HELLO, so its SUCCESS keys can be asserted. Only the presence of
# server and connection_id is pinned; hints and patch_bolt are not.
!: BOLT 4.4

C: HELLO {"user_agent": "relate-bolt-compat/1.0", "scheme": "none"}
S: SUCCESS {"server": "*", "connection_id": "*"}
C: RESET
S: SUCCESS {}
C: GOODBYE
S: <EXIT>
